      "quote": "We included randomised trials in people with suspected, probable, or confirmed covid-19 that compared blood products and covid-19-specific antiviral antibodies against one another or against no intervention, placebo, or standard care. ... We excluded randomised trials evaluating vaccines, pharmacologic drugs, nutrition, traditional Chinese herbal medicines, and non-drug supportive care interventions. ... We excluded non-randomised trials.",
      "reason": "The review specifies the study design (randomised trials), the population (people with suspected, probable, or confirmed covid-19), the interventions (blood products and covid-19-specific antiviral antibodies), and the comparators (one another, no intervention, placebo, or standard care)."
