      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_15",
      "quote": "We included trials regardless of publication status (peer reviewed, in press, or preprint) or language.",
      "reason": "The review specifies eligibility criteria regarding publication status and language. While a specific dissemination year range is not explicitly stated as an eligibility criterion, the search strategy (text_13) covers the relevant period from 1 December 2019 to 21 July 2021."
